Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.40,0:28:20.51,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Como se eu fosse derreter, as lágrimas escorrem
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.51,0:28:32.19,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur10}{\t(0,439,\blur5)}{\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(11430,11475,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(439,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}sonna koori no ningyou mitai ni narenaikara
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.51,0:28:32.19,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur10}{\t(0,439,\blur0.5)}{\bord0\4a&HFF&}{\fad(439,250)\c&HD9DCD9&\3a&H19&}sonna koori no ningyou mitai ni narenaikara
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.51,0:28:32.19,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Mas não posso ser como uma boneca de gelo
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.80,0:28:44.45,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(8400,8445,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}mou nigenai shiritai no
