Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.80,0:28:44.45,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Não vou mais fugir
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.65,0:28:45.65,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(750,795,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}tsuyoku
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.65,0:28:45.65,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}{\fad(250,250)\c&HD9DCD9&\3a&H19&}tsuyoku
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.65,0:28:45.65,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Eu preciso saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.66,0:28:47.42,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Eu acredito, acredito em você
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.66,0:28:47.42,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(1510,1555,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}I believe, believe in you
Dialogue: 1,0:28:45.66,0:28:47.42,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}{\fad(250,250)\3a&H19&}I believe, believe in you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.42,0:28:51.44,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(3770,3815,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,250)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}kitto ichiban no yakusoku no kotoba
Dialogue: 1,0:28:47.42,0:28:51.44,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}{\fad(250,250)\3a&H19&}kitto ichiban no yakusoku no kotoba
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.42,0:28:51.44,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Tenho certeza de que é a promessa mais importante que já fiz
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.44,0:28:55.75,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(205,250,\1a&H00&)\t(4420,4465,\1a&HFF&)}{\fad(250,600)\3c&H000000&\c&H000000&\3a&H19&}itai kurai nigitte hanasanai
Dialogue: 1,0:28:51.44,0:28:55.75,ED2 - Romaji (v0),,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}{\fad(250,600)\3a&H19&}itai kurai nigitte hanasanai
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.44,0:28:55.75,ED2 - English (v0),,0,0,0,,Por isso vou me agarrar a ela e não vou soltar
